Package: com.kcs.showcase.remote
Name: Showcase Remote Access
Version: 0.1-1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Section: Networking
Maintainer: KCS <info@kcs.net.tr>
Author: KCS <info@kcs.net.tr>
Depends: openssh, curl
Conflicts: dropbear
Homepage: https://github.com/inckerem/showcase
Description: Secure reverse-SSH link to the KCS server for this device.
 Opens an outbound-only SSH tunnel from this device to the KCS server so an
 operator can reach its sshd through the server's loopback. The device never
 exposes an inbound port. On install the device generates its own key, pins
 the server host key and enrolls its public key; an operator authorizes it
 server-side. Removing the package tears the tunnel down and unloads the job.
